  "title": "Report drafting review",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Report drafting review</h2><p>Identify the correct reporting concept for each drafting note.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m4-tbs3-f1\">Reporting concept for A</label><select id=\"aud-m4-tbs3-f1\"><option value=\"Potential critical audit matter\">Potential critical audit matter</option><option value=\"A separate guaranteed valuation opinion\">A separate guaranteed valuation opinion</option><option value=\"A tax return certification\">A tax return certification</option><option value=\"Automatic disclaimer\">Automatic disclaimer</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m4-tbs3-f2\">Reporting concept for B</label><select id=\"aud-m4-tbs3-f2\"><option value=\"Emphasis of matter\">Emphasis of matter</option><option value=\"Automatic adverse opinion\">Automatic adverse opinion</option><option value=\"An omitted basis section\">An omitted basis section</option><option value=\"A management representation\">A management representation</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m4-tbs3-f3\">Framework for C</label><select id=\"aud-m4-tbs3-f3\"><option value=\"Special-purpose tax basis\">Special-purpose tax basis</option><option value=\"U.S. GAAP automatically\">U.S. GAAP automatically</option><option value=\"A sampling framework\">A sampling framework</option><option value=\"No financial-reporting framework\">No financial-reporting framework</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m4-tbs3-f4\">Correction required for D</label><select id=\"aud-m4-tbs3-f4\"><option value=\"Evaluate the opinion modification separately\">Evaluate the opinion modification separately</option><option value=\"Use the CAM to cure the departure\">Use the CAM to cure the departure</option><option value=\"Delete the opinion section\">Delete the opinion section</option><option value=\"Let management choose the audit opinion\">Let management choose the audit opinion</option></select></div></section>",
