      "id": "aud-m4-tbs3-ex1",
      "title": "Drafting notes",
      "html": "<p>A: A material issuer estimate required especially challenging judgment and was communicated to the audit committee. B: The report highlights an appropriately disclosed matter fundamental to understanding the statements. C: Financial statements are prepared on a tax basis. D: The draft suggests a CAM can replace a qualification for a known departure.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "aud-m4-tbs3-ex2",
      "title": "Instructions",
      "html": "<p>Assume the relevant engagement standard permits or requires the report sections described. Focus on their function rather than copying a report template.</p>"
    }
