  "explanation": "<h3>Reporting concept for A</h3><p>The facts fit the CAM evaluation criteria.</p><h3>Reporting concept for B</h3><p>The paragraph draws attention to an appropriately disclosed fundamental matter.</p><h3>Framework for C</h3><p>Tax-basis statements use a special-purpose framework.</p><h3>Correction required for D</h3><p>CAM communication does not replace required opinion modification.</p>"
